        <div class="turn-content"><p>Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. Long reply. </p></div>
        <div class="triage" data-msg-id="s4">
             <button type="button" data-state="clean" class="triage-btn clean" title="Mark clean">✓</button>
             <button type="button" data-state="warn" class="triage-btn warn" title="Mark borderline">!</button>
             <button type="button" data-state="fail" class="triage-btn fail" title="Mark failure">✗</button>
             <select class="dim-select" aria-label="Quality dimension that failed">
               <option value="">— dimension —</option>
               <option value="Routing correctness">Routing correctness</option><option value="Product accuracy">Product accuracy</option><option value="Account/subscription policy">Account/subscription policy</option><option value="Citation / DOI integrity">Citation / DOI integrity</option><option value="Unprompted supplement mentions">Unprompted supplement mentions</option><option value="Hallucinations">Hallucinations</option><option value="Clinical safety">Clinical safety</option><option value="Brand voice">Brand voice</option><option value="Refusal correctness">Refusal correctness</option><option value="Multi-turn context">Multi-turn context</option><option value="Frustration signals">Frustration signals</option>
